  "name": "[NLT time series: 2014-2016 temperature and depth] - Nearshore Larval Transport (NLT) temperature time-series data from nearshore La Jolla, Southern California, 2014-2016 (Nearshore larval transport: physical and biological processes)",
  "description": "This dataset includes temperature and water depth time series data from intertidal, 1, 2, 5, 6, and 8-meter sites located nearshore Calumet Park, La Jolla, Southern California, April 2014 through November 2016.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nsampling_year (unitless)\nseason (unitless)\nsite (unitless)\nsite_name (unitless)\ndepth (m)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nmonth (unitless)\nyear (unitless)\nday (unitless)\nhour (unitless)\ntime (ISO Date Time UTC, seconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z)\nyrday_utc (unitless)\ndepth_w (Depth, meters)\ntemp (Temperature, degrees Celsius)\n",
